From: The Tidemark Authors
Subject: [PATCH] v1/sched: engine-local admission hooks for Tidemark background prefill

Adds three calls into Scheduler.schedule() so an out-of-tree shim can size
background prefill-only requests against the safe budget of the current
iteration and report their completion. Foreground scheduling is unchanged.

